  },
  {
    "who": "leon",
    "message": "Simplest plan:\n\n1. **Train from Rossio** to Sintra — every ~20 min, about 40 min, a few euros with a Navegante card.\n2. Walk 10 min to **Quinta da Regaleira** first (opens 9:30) — the initiation well is quieter early.\n3. Take the **434 bus** (or a tuk‑tuk) up to **Pena**. Book a timed Pena ticket for around 13:00 on the Parques de Sintra site.\n4. Back down for a late lunch and *travesseiros* at Piriquita, then the train home.\n\nAvoid Saturdays if you can — the 434 queue can take 45 minutes.",
